<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-AUXERRE 1 GRASSHOPPER 0 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUXERRE 1 GRASSHOPPER 0 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>AUXERRE, France 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
